   "text": "University of Wolverhampton International Study Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Wolverhampton International Study Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Wolverhampton International Study Centre provides specialist tuition in English language, study skills and subject preparation. You’ll study programmes developed in collaboration with the University of Wolverhampton in preparation for your university degree.\nYou will learn in a supportive environment, in small class sizes with other international students from all over the world. With regular personal tutorial sessions, supplementary classes, and a timetable designed to maximise your ability to learn, our experienced staff will help you reach your full potential.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 08:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £15,950.00\nMin: £14,950.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n3%\n150 of 4,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nMalvern International PLC\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nWolverhampton\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBangladesh, India, Sri Lanka, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/03/2023\nContract End Date\n10/04/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://isc.wlv.ac.uk/international-study-centre/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CRHWefUF6Mc\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
